{"5395140":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Have you seen my knife?","steam_appid":5395140,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TIDYING UP HAS NEVER BEEN THIS LOUD<\/h2><i>&quot;Have you seen my knife? No? Well, tidy up a bit while I look for it.&quot;<\/i><br>What's coming through the skylight isn't rain: it's more than 1,800 parts from 216 unique guns and 17 ammo boxes, all with physics, all in one huge pile in the middle of the workshop.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5395140\/extras\/807c2500ad2471fadf4a46515d156b28.poster.avif?t=1793728555\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5395140\/extras\/807c2500ad2471fadf4a46515d156b28.webm?t=1793728555\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5395140\/extras\/807c2500ad2471fadf4a46515d156b28.mp4?t=1793728555\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PIECE BY PIECE<\/h2>Find a base, bring it to the bench and watch its blueprint appear. Every part fits in exactly one place, and the blueprint shows what's still missing.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5395140\/extras\/500706250db6e0abff9bf4fc1c0d1304.poster.avif?t=1793728555\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5395140\/extras\/500706250db6e0abff9bf4fc1c0d1304.webm?t=1793728555\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5395140\/extras\/500706250db6e0abff9bf4fc1c0d1304.mp4?t=1793728555\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOU BUILT IT. NOW TEST IT.<\/h2>A finished gun doesn't have to go straight into its case. Mess with the environment and shoot at everything you see. Grenade launchers, rockets, flares, a taser: everything works.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5395140\/extras\/c078c69345465343f7d19f7344f72a14.poster.avif?t=1793728555\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5395140\/extras\/c078c69345465343f7d19f7344f72a14.webm?t=1793728555\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5395140\/extras\/c078c69345465343f7d19f7344f72a14.mp4?t=1793728555\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOUR WORKSHOP IS A SANDBOX<\/h2>It isn't easy: some parts look way too alike and some guns are always missing just one. But there are no timers and no way to lose, so you go at your own pace. Walk on the pile, throw parts around, sort them into bins, stir everything up with the shovel, or spend a while test-firing before you get back to work. And the workshop keeps a secret or two for those who take the time to look around.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5395140\/extras\/e23eb635d5710102cb701d428a3401e1.poster.avif?t=1793728555\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5395140\/extras\/e23eb635d5710102cb701d428a3401e1.webm?t=1793728555\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5395140\/extras\/e23eb635d5710102cb701d428a3401e1.mp4?t=1793728555\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TOOLS AND POWERS<\/h2>Earn money for every part you fit and spend it at the shop board:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Bins:<\/strong> scoop up parts by the handful and carry them to the bench.<br><\/li><li><strong>Shovel:<\/strong> stir the pile to find what's buried at the bottom.<br><\/li><li><strong>Magnet:<\/strong> pulls in every part of the gun you're building.<br><\/li><li><strong>Color tracking:<\/strong> paints the parts of each gun on your bench in its own color.<br><\/li><li><strong>A second bench<\/strong> to build four guns at once, plus more carrying capacity and speed.<\/li><\/ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5395140\/extras\/e0f09c1b3cc356737bc59a5872b5af13.poster.avif?t=1793728555\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5395140\/extras\/e0f09c1b3cc356737bc59a5872b5af13.webm?t=1793728555\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5395140\/extras\/e0f09c1b3cc356737bc59a5872b5af13.mp4?t=1793728555\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FROM CHAOS TO ORDER<\/h2>Every gun has its own case on the wall, and every ammo box gets filled one bullet at a time. Four styles of guns, and a whole armory to fill. As for the knife… still no sign of it.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5395140\/extras\/6b21df2fc952e86ba417f9c4523a2206.poster.avif?t=1793728555\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5395140\/extras\/6b21df2fc952e86ba417f9c4523a2206.webm?t=1793728555\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5395140\/extras\/6b21df2fc952e86ba417f9c4523a2206.mp4?t=1793728555\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>More than 1,800 parts with real physics in a single pile.<br><\/li><li>216 unique guns to assemble and test, in 4 styles.<br><\/li><li>17 ammo boxes to fill one bullet at a time.<br><\/li><li>Shoot at everything you see with every gun you build.<br><\/li><li>A real challenge, but no timers: play at your own pace.<br><\/li><li>Bins, shovel, magnet and color tracking.<br><\/li><li>30 Steam achievements.<br><\/li><li>4 to 5 hours to get everything in order.<\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TIDYING UP HAS NEVER BEEN THIS LOUD<\/h2><i>&quot;Have you seen my knife? No? Well, tidy up a bit while I look for it.&quot;<\/i><br>What's coming through the skylight isn't rain: it's more than 1,800 parts from 216 unique guns and 17 ammo boxes, all with physics, all in one huge pile in the middle of the workshop.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5395140\/extras\/807c2500ad2471fadf4a46515d156b28.poster.avif?t=1793728555\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5395140\/extras\/807c2500ad2471fadf4a46515d156b28.webm?t=1793728555\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5395140\/extras\/807c2500ad2471fadf4a46515d156b28.mp4?t=1793728555\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PIECE BY PIECE<\/h2>Find a base, bring it to the bench and watch its blueprint appear. Every part fits in exactly one place, and the blueprint shows what's still missing.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5395140\/extras\/500706250db6e0abff9bf4fc1c0d1304.poster.avif?t=1793728555\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5395140\/extras\/500706250db6e0abff9bf4fc1c0d1304.webm?t=1793728555\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5395140\/extras\/500706250db6e0abff9bf4fc1c0d1304.mp4?t=1793728555\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOU BUILT IT. NOW TEST IT.<\/h2>A finished gun doesn't have to go straight into its case. Mess with the environment and shoot at everything you see. Grenade launchers, rockets, flares, a taser: everything works.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5395140\/extras\/c078c69345465343f7d19f7344f72a14.poster.avif?t=1793728555\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5395140\/extras\/c078c69345465343f7d19f7344f72a14.webm?t=1793728555\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5395140\/extras\/c078c69345465343f7d19f7344f72a14.mp4?t=1793728555\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOUR WORKSHOP IS A SANDBOX<\/h2>It isn't easy: some parts look way too alike and some guns are always missing just one. But there are no timers and no way to lose, so you go at your own pace. Walk on the pile, throw parts around, sort them into bins, stir everything up with the shovel, or spend a while test-firing before you get back to work. And the workshop keeps a secret or two for those who take the time to look around.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5395140\/extras\/e23eb635d5710102cb701d428a3401e1.poster.avif?t=1793728555\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5395140\/extras\/e23eb635d5710102cb701d428a3401e1.webm?t=1793728555\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5395140\/extras\/e23eb635d5710102cb701d428a3401e1.mp4?t=1793728555\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TOOLS AND POWERS<\/h2>Earn money for every part you fit and spend it at the shop board:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Bins:<\/strong> scoop up parts by the handful and carry them to the bench.<br><\/li><li><strong>Shovel:<\/strong> stir the pile to find what's buried at the bottom.<br><\/li><li><strong>Magnet:<\/strong> pulls in every part of the gun you're building.<br><\/li><li><strong>Color tracking:<\/strong> paints the parts of each gun on your bench in its own color.<br><\/li><li><strong>A second bench<\/strong> to build four guns at once, plus more carrying capacity and speed.<\/li><\/ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5395140\/extras\/e0f09c1b3cc356737bc59a5872b5af13.poster.avif?t=1793728555\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5395140\/extras\/e0f09c1b3cc356737bc59a5872b5af13.webm?t=1793728555\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5395140\/extras\/e0f09c1b3cc356737bc59a5872b5af13.mp4?t=1793728555\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FROM CHAOS TO ORDER<\/h2>Every gun has its own case on the wall, and every ammo box gets filled one bullet at a time. Four styles of guns, and a whole armory to fill. As for the knife… still no sign of it.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5395140\/extras\/6b21df2fc952e86ba417f9c4523a2206.poster.avif?t=1793728555\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5395140\/extras\/6b21df2fc952e86ba417f9c4523a2206.webm?t=1793728555\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5395140\/extras\/6b21df2fc952e86ba417f9c4523a2206.mp4?t=1793728555\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>More than 1,800 parts with real physics in a single pile.<br><\/li><li>216 unique guns to assemble and test, in 4 styles.<br><\/li><li>17 ammo boxes to fill one bullet at a time.<br><\/li><li>Shoot at everything you see with every gun you build.<br><\/li><li>A real challenge, but no timers: play at your own pace.<br><\/li><li>Bins, shovel, magnet and color tracking.<br><\/li><li>30 Steam achievements.<br><\/li><li>4 to 5 hours to get everything in order.<\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"More than 1,800 parts from 216 unique guns and 17 ammo boxes rain down on your workshop. Assemble each gun part by part, test-fire it and rack it in its case on the wall. Tidying up has never been this loud.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*<\/strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*<\/strong>, German<strong>*<\/strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*<\/strong>, Traditional Chinese<strong>*<\/strong>, Japanese<strong>*<\/strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*<\/strong>, Russian<strong>*<\/strong>, French<strong>*<\/strong><br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5395140\/94858d0e6e5ab5ec73703a4ec03c59351684f7f5\/header.jpg?t=1793728555","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5395140\/75b82f27f885b88b057211fa541abd57d02edd90\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793728555","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5395140\/75b82f27f885b88b057211fa541abd57d02edd90\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793728555","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> 4 cores, Intel Core i5-4590 or AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 or AMD RX 580<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 12<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 2 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> 1080p, low settings, 60 fps<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10\/11 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i7-10700K or AMD Ryzen 7 3700X<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 16 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA RTX 2070 Super or AMD RX 5700 XT<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 12<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 2 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> 1080p, high settings, 60 fps<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"developers":["BroDevs"],"publishers":["BroDevs"],"price_overview":{"currency":"EU